  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Before importing the full model, it's important to configure
      the import settings. These affect how geometry, metadata, and scale are processed.\n\n<b>Important:</b>
      Correct unit scaling ensures your CAD model appears at the correct size in
      Unity\u2019s world space."
