    m_Untranslated: '<b>Note</b>: After import, the button will change to <b>Re-Import</b>.


      Your
      CAD model is now fully configured and imported into Unity, optimized with high-quality
      geometry and metadata intact.


      You can read more about the various import
      settings in the ATT <a href="https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.industry.toolkit@3.2/manual/import-model-parameters.html">documentation</a>

'
