  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'The imported CAD model appears as a <b>Prefab</b> in your <b>Project
      window</b>. You can now place it into your scene and inspect its structure
      and metadata.

      <b>Tip:</b> Metadata can be used in scripts to find and
      categorize objects.'
