  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Now that the toolkit is installed, you can begin importing a
      CAD file using the <b>Unity Asset Transformer Toolbar</b>. This process sets
      up the import pipeline and creates an Import ScriptableObject, which stores
      your settings.\n<b>Note:</b> The Import ScriptableObject isn\u2019t the model
      itself\u2014it\u2019s a reusable settings container."
